  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Pattern: Xが{咲|さ}く (X blooms).\n\nASPECT: {咲|さ}いている indicates flowers are currently in bloom.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {桜|さくら}が{咲|さ}く (cherry blossoms bloom)\n- {花|はな}が{咲|さ}く (flowers bloom)\n- {満開|まんかい}に{咲|さ}く (bloom in full)\n- {綺麗|きれい}に{咲|さ}く (bloom beautifully)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {笑顔|えがお}が{咲|さ}く (a smile blooms/breaks out)\n- {話|はな}に{花|はな}が{咲|さ}く (conversation flourishes)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {散|ち}る (to fall/scatter - for petals)",
